CAD-AI — Aria Powered
Data Lifecycle, Retention & Provenance System
Version 1.0
Status: Implementation Specification
Database: PostgreSQL
Artifact Storage: Object Storage
API: REST / JSON
API Version: /api/v1
Identifiers: UUID
Primary Model: Versioned OneDraft Project Model
